[I] Kernel-enforced sandbox and runtime security tool for AI agents

[T] nono is an agent runtime security tool that runs AI coding agents and
[T] their tools in unprivileged, kernel-enforced sandboxes. It controls
[T] file, network and credential access through composable policy profiles,
[T] injects credentials via a proxy, verifies skills with Sigstore and keeps
[T] a tamper-evident audit log with rollback of file changes.

[U] https://github.com/nolabs-ai/nono

